  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 200°C/180°C fan-forced.\n• Tear bake-at-home ciabatta (see ingredients) into small chunks.\n• Place torn ciabatta on a second lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and sprinkle with garlic and Italian herbs. Season, then toss to coat. Bake until golden, 8-10 minutes.\n• Finely chop garlic. Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• In a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/642cd6f3bc8c6f42ea040ca3/step-f298e5f4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, when the croutons are almost done, drain haloumi and pat dry.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/642cd6f3bc8c6f42ea040ca3/step-ef7fd4e8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Combine the honey and a drizzle of olive oil and vinegar in a large bowl. Season to taste.\n• Add mixed salad leaves, shaved Parmesan cheese and croutons. Toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/642cd6f3bc8c6f42ea040ca3/step-3b2944b4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide panzanella-style salad between plates. Top with haloumi, spooning over red pesto.\n• Serve with garlic aioli. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/642cd6f3bc8c6f42ea040ca3/step-e8cd9431.jpg"
    }
  ]
